# lab.surface: the lab bench's red-green build (tools/lab_bench.py, 2026-10-20) as a game codebase,
# so a diff or a live look can judge it. It was built once by the bench; this script has no apply.
# Rory powered it with the editor (an energy interface at 217,200, on the plot's top edge): kept as
# a mark of his (lab.fkp), never reverted.
surface  lab
# (3.1) `mode lab` was here: a surface has properties now: free, and the paste's force
free
force    lab
terrain  none
catalog  base

place main = main plot 200,200 63x50

watch plots:      keep
watch sanctioned: mark 2h
notify            all
